@startuml F5.10-D01-EGRESSOS-listar
title F5.10-D01-EGRESSOS — Listar egressos
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "EgressosController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: /secretaria/egressos
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /egressos
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT + JOIN\ngraduation_record
note right of Ctrl
  confirm-delivery só se
  situacao = PENDENTE
end note
Postgres --> Ctrl: page
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + _links
WebApp --> Sec: tabela filtrada

@enduml
